A '''shimmering barrier''' can be found within the [[Chambers of Xeric/Strategies#Tightrope)|tightrope room]] during a [[Chambers of Xeric]] raid. The barrier is blocking the path to the next room, and must be dispelled with a [[keystone crystal]].  The keystone is obtainable by successfully and safely crossing the [[tightrope (Chambers of Xeric)|tightrope]] within the room. Points for the raid will be awarded to the player dispelling the barrier.

When the barrier is dispelled with the keystone, any surviving enemies will be killed.

